{"id":"707d0901571a9d94","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/010_一阶关系演算.md","title":"010 一阶关系演算","display":"010_一阶关系演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始数据\">1. 原始数据</h1>\n<p>变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系签名为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_R=(\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_R=(\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}:\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}:\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有函数符号、常元符号和等号；项只能是变量项。</p>\n<p>原始数据记录定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Data}_{RC}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathcal R,\n\\operatorname{rel}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Data}_{RC}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathcal R,\n\\operatorname{rel}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该对象要求项形成只含变量项，原子公式形成只含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p>项集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{RC}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Tm}_{RC}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系原子集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}_{RC}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau):\nR\\in\\mathcal R,\\ \\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n,\\ \\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{At}_{RC}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau):\nR\\in\\mathcal R,\\ \\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n,\\ \\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC};\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC};\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"2\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量\">3. 自由变量</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\{\\tau(i):i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\{\\tau(i):i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))=\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))=\\operatorname{BV}_{RC}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-变量替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">4. 变量替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>关系演算的替换只允许变量替换变量：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{RC}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{RC}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对关系原子，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\">\\(A=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau&#39;:\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)\\to\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\tau&#39;:\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau&#39;(i)=\n\\begin{cases}\ny,&amp;\\tau(i)=x,\\\\\n\\tau(i),&amp;\\tau(i)\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau&#39;(i)=\n\\begin{cases}\ny,&amp;\\tau(i)=x,\\\\\n\\tau(i),&amp;\\tau(i)\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A[x:=y]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A[x:=y]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>否定与蕴含子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[x:=y]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[x:=y]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[x:=y],B[x:=y]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[x:=y],B[x:=y]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\operatorname{all}(z,A)\">\\(C=\\operatorname{all}(z,A)\\)</span>，则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=y]=C\\quad(z=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=y]=C\\quad(z=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(z,A[x:=y])\n\\quad(z\\ne x,\\ z\\ne y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(z,A[x:=y])\n\\quad(z\\ne x,\\ z\\ne y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\ne x\">\\(z\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=y\">\\(z=y\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\cup\\{x,y,z\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\cup\\{x,y,z\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(w,(A[z:=w])[x:=y]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(w,(A[z:=w])[x:=y]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{RC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{RC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span> 上的等价关系；\n1.1. 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\delta:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\tau,\\delta:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(i)=\\delta(i)\">\\(\\tau(i)=\\delta(i)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 成立，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\delta))\\in E;\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\delta))\\in E;\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"2\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))\\in E\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{imp}(A_0,A_1),\\operatorname{imp}(B_0,B_1))\\in E;\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{imp}(A_0,A_1),\\operatorname{imp}(B_0,B_1))\\in E;\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"4\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\\operatorname{all}(x,B))\\in E;\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\\operatorname{all}(x,B))\\in E;\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"5\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\n\\operatorname{all}(y,A[x:=y]))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\n\\operatorname{all}(y,A[x:=y]))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理与规则\">5. 公理与规则</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{RC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{RC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中命题三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{RC}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\to A[x:=y]:\nx,y\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{RC}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\to A[x:=y]:\nx,y\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\operatorname{all}(x,B)):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\operatorname{all}(x,B)):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RC}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RC}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RC}\n=\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}(x,A)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RC}\n=\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}(x,A)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RC}\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{RC}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RC}\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{RC}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span> 出发的证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，至少满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RC}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RC}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\operatorname{all}(x,A_j)\">\\(A_i=\\operatorname{all}(x,A_j)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RC}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RC}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RC}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RC}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{RC}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{RC}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的证明且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明行许可与推导闭包\">7. 证明行许可与推导闭包</h1>\n<p>公式形成第 2 节中的原子子句等价于</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}_{RC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{At}_{RC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}\">\\(\\operatorname{eq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}\">\\(\\operatorname{fun}\\)</span> 形成子句。量词公理一已经以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{RC}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{RC}\\)</span> 进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC}\\)</span>，其中替换参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 是变量名，不能是函数项。</p>\n<p>证明行许可谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{RC}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{RC}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\">\\(\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\)</span> 且满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC}\">\\(\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RC}\">\\(((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RC}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)=\\operatorname{all}(x,\\pi(j))\">\\(\\pi(i)=\\operatorname{all}(x,\\pi(j))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RC}\">\\(((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RC}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RC}\">\\(((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RC}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明对象集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}):m&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{RC}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}):m&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{RC}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此上面的可证性记号等价于</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{RC}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\\,\nA_{m-1}=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{RC}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\\,\nA_{m-1}=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义关系演算闭包对象</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{RC}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cn}_{RC}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{RC}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.1-目标区分条款\">7.1 目标区分条款</h1>\n<p>定义关系演算构造子集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctor}_{RC}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctor}_{RC}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{RC}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{fun}\\notin\\mathsf{Ctor}_{RC}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{eq}\\notin\\mathsf{Ctor}_{RC}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{RC}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\quad\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{RC}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{RC}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{RC}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{fun}\\notin\\mathsf{Ctor}_{RC}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{eq}\\notin\\mathsf{Ctor}_{RC}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{RC}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}\\quad\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{RC}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{RC}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此本系统的每个原子均为关系原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\)</span>，且每个项位置只能出现变量项。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{RelCalc}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{RC},\n\\mathsf{At}_{RC},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RC},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RC},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{RC},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{RC},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{RC},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RC},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RC},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RC},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{RC},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{RC},\n\\vdash_{RC},\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{RC},\n\\Delta_{RC}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{RelCalc}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{RC},\n\\mathsf{At}_{RC},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RC},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RC},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{RC},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{RC},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{RC},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{RC},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RC},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RC},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RC},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{RC},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{RC},\n\\vdash_{RC},\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{RC},\n\\Delta_{RC}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含变量项、关系原子、变量替换、量词、公理、有限证明、闭包对象和目标差异条件；不含函数项、等号、结构或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始数据","text":"1. 原始数据","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量","text":"3. 自由变量","level":1},{"id":"4.-变量替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"4. 变量替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理与规则","text":"5. 公理与规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明行许可与推导闭包","text":"7. 证明行许可与推导闭包","level":1},{"id":"7.1-目标区分条款","text":"7.1 目标区分条款","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,","display":true},{"tex":"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_R=(\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}:\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Data}_{RC}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathcal R,\n\\operatorname{rel}\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{RC}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}_{RC}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau):\nR\\in\\mathcal R,\\ \\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n,\\ \\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC};","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RC}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\m